Feature: MACD Breakout with Volume and Trend Confirmation
  Primary timeframe: 1h
  Parameter macd_fast default 12
  Parameter macd_slow default 26
  Parameter macd_sig default 9
  Parameter vol_period default 20
  Parameter trend_period default 100
  Parameter stop_loss_pct default 4

  Background:
    Given a series macd defined as macd_line(macd_fast, macd_slow, macd_sig)
    And a series signal defined as macd_signal(macd_fast, macd_slow, macd_sig)
    And a series avg_vol defined as avg_volume(vol_period)
    And a series trend defined as ema(trend_period)

  Scenario: Enter long on MACD bullish cross with volume in uptrend
    Given no open position
    When macd crosses above signal
    And volume is above avg_vol
    And close is above trend
    Then long_entry
    And with stop_loss at entry_price * (1 - stop_loss_pct / 100)

  Scenario: Exit long on MACD bearish cross
    Given a long position is open
    When macd crosses below signal
    Then long_exit

  Scenario: Enter short on MACD bearish cross with volume in downtrend
    Given no open position
    When macd crosses below signal
    And volume is above avg_vol
    And close is below trend
    Then short_entry
    And with stop_loss at entry_price * (1 + stop_loss_pct / 100)

  Scenario: Exit short on MACD bullish cross
    Given a short position is open
    When macd crosses above signal
    Then short_exit
